	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Type pour un intervalle de temps]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=17284#p17284"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Un petit exemple d&#039;utilisation :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>postgres=# create table toto(c1 interval);
CREATE TABLE
postgres=# insert into toto values (&#039;15 minutes&#039;);
INSERT 0 1
postgres=# select * from toto;
    c1    
----------
 00:15:00
(1 row)

postgres=# select now(), now()-c1 from toto;
              now              |           ?column?            
-------------------------------+-------------------------------
 2013-05-28 13:35:03.996505+02 | 2013-05-28 13:20:03.996505+02
(1 row)</code></pre></div>]]></content>
