		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=17281#p17281"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>de la doc : </p><p>The interval type has an additional option, which is to restrict the set of stored fields by writing one of these phrases:</p><p>YEAR<br />MONTH<br />DAY<br />HOUR<br />MINUTE<br />SECOND<br />YEAR TO MONTH<br />DAY TO HOUR<br />DAY TO MINUTE<br />DAY TO SECOND<br />HOUR TO MINUTE<br />HOUR TO SECOND<br />MINUTE TO SECOND</p><p>en espérant que ça soit la réponse</p>]]></content>
